  "tip": [
    {
      "id": "p1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "be made up of 是常考词组，常出现在保持句意基本不变的句型转换练习中，所以学生一定要知道：be made up of 与 consist of 意思相同，在句中可以互换。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "例如：Desktop computers "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "are made up of"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " three main parts."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "= Desktop computers usually "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "consist of"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " three main parts."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "台式电脑是由三个主要部件组成的。"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
